! Synthetic FullProf resolution file (invented numbers): the Lorentzian width turns negative at long d; a large alph0, a negative alph1
!  Type of profile function: back-to-back exponentials * pseudo-Voigt
NPROF 9
!       Tof-min(us)    step      Tof-max(us)
TOFRG    7000 8.0 46000
!       Zero     Dtt1        Dtt2
ZD2TOF   -5.5 14000.0 -3.4
!     TOF-TWOTH of the bank
TWOTH    20.0
!       Sig-2     Sig-1     Sig-0
SIGMA    3.0 30.0 25.0
!       Gam-2     Gam-1     Gam-0
GAMMA    -3.0 7.5 -1.0
!          alph0       beta0       alph1       beta1
ALFBE    13.0 0.36 -0.4 0.1
END
